  "body": "Applies the upstream Sepo agent-infrastructure update (the same sync lean-workspace-template took in `acbeec9`, plus the follow-up `/chat` alias fix `4508c51`). Cherry-picked cleanly — the pre-update baseline here was byte-identical to lean's.\n\nBrings:\n- Live progress comments with thumbs-down cancellation (`AGENT_PROGRESS_POLICY`, route-aware policies, merge-mode final comment)\n- `/add-rubrics` route + prompt\n- `download-github-attachment` CLI (private user attachments with token lookup, timeouts, size caps)\n- `deployments`/`actor-association`/`env` module refactors, expanded reactions API\n- `/chat` as an alias for `/answer`\n- Claude date-pinned model fix (`ANTHROPIC_MODEL`)\n- ~2.4k lines of new runtime tests\n\nVerified locally: all `.agent` test lanes pass (`test:ci` — runtime 741/741, workflow/docs/shell checks green).\n\n**Stack 1/5** — merge order: this → review-nudge → agents-md → issue-templates → quartz-fixes.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01KSJ1viQV4pp3hcWo9u5oPV",
